cleanly (both missing cells, cd82 trial=1 and sk48 trial=1, ran to
completion; the reaper struck only AFTER sk48's measurement was captured,
correctly excluded by the harness's own substrate-change guard).

Final analysis (results/experiment_6091_refine_engine_visible_analysis.json):
honest_verdict=blocked_underpowered_no_p_below_0_05_reachable_not_a_refutation.
